cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite both the software (this file) and
  the accompanying paper listed under `preferred-citation`.
title: >-
  PachnerDCG: certificates and code for component trees of Pachner graphs
abstract: >-
  Computational certificates and verification code accompanying the paper
  "Component Trees of Pachner Graphs with Applications to Triangulated
  3-Spheres". Includes self-contained, independently checkable Pachner-move
  certificates for small triangulated 3-spheres -- the ten-, eleven-, and
  high-valence twelve-vertex seed lists, and one-facet-subdivision
  certificates for the four known unflippable 3-spheres U(16), U(20),
  U_1(21), and U_2(21) -- together with the code, summaries, and checkpoints
  for the surface flip-graph stabilization experiments.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Faber
    given-names: Vance
    email: vance.faber@gmail.com
    city: Hoquiam
    region: Washington
    country: US
  - family-names: Murphy
